      "title": "Supreme Court sets Sunday hearing of contempt plea against October 10 Delhi transit shutdown",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/supreme-court-sets-sunday-hearing-of-contempt-plea-against-october-10-delhi-transit-shutdown/article71568844.ece",
      "description": "In the petition, advocate Shailendra Mani Tripathi argued that the shutdown violated the Supreme Court’s October 9 order, which barred blanket bans that cause hardship to ordinary commuters",
